			<key>other</key>
			<string>%lld places</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>The saved report and the copied summary count %lld findings. The list has %lld items and is full, so findings it has no room for are left out: save the report to see them all. Also, a credential found by more than one rule, or in more than one file, is one item.</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>The saved report and the copied summary count %1$#@findings@. The list has %2$#@items@ and is full, so findings it has no room for are left out: save the report to see them all. Also, a credential found by more than one rule, or in more than one file, is one item.</string>
		<key>findings</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>%1$lld finding</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>%1$lld findings</string>
		</dict>
		<key>items</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>%2$lld item</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>%2$lld items</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>The saved report and the copied summary count %lld findings. The list has %lld items, because a credential found by more than one rule, or in more than one file, is one item.</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>The saved report and the copied summary count %1$#@findings@. The list has %2$#@items@, because a credential found by more than one rule, or in more than one file, is one item.</string>
		<key>findings</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>%1$lld finding</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>%1$lld findings</string>
		</dict>
		<key>items</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>%2$lld item</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>%2$lld items</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
